       ("How to reply", "<p>You must verify your business before you can reply. Then go to your Business Profile, select Read reviews, choose Reply next to a review, write your reply and submit. Google reviews replies against its content policies; most take up to 10 minutes to appear, though some can take up to 30 days.</p>"),
